  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## BÊTA — Confirmation\n\n`GET https://n8n.azy.education/webhook/beta-confirmation?jeton=…`\n\nLe lien reçu par courriel. Le jeton en clair n'est **jamais** comparé à la base :\non en calcule l'empreinte SHA-256, et c'est elle qu'on cherche.\n\nLa requête SQL fait tout d'un coup — elle ne confirme que si le jeton existe, n'a\npas déjà servi et n'a pas expiré. Trois cas, une seule requête, pas de fenêtre entre\nla lecture et l'écriture.\n\nSuccès → redirection vers `https://azy.education/merci.html`\nÉchec, lien déjà utilisé ou expiré → `https://azy.education/lien-expire.html`\n\nL'alerte Discord est **désactivée** (nœud grisé). Si vous l'activez, elle n'envoie\nni nom ni adresse — seulement le profil et l'heure.",
        "height": 400,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "documentation",
      "name": "Documentation",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -80,
        -320
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "GET",
        "path": "beta-confirmation",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "webhook",
      "name": "Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        0,
        300
      ],
      "webhookId": "b1e7a2c4-0002-4c8a-9d0e-1f2a3b4c5d02"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "action": "hash",
        "type": "SHA256",
        "value": "={{ $json.query.jeton || '' }}",
        "dataPropertyName": "jeton_empreinte",
        "encoding": "hex"
      },
      "id": "empreinte-du-jeton-reçu",
      "name": "Empreinte du jeton reçu",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.crypto",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        220,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "executeQuery",
        "query": "UPDATE beta_inscriptions\n   SET confirme_le = now(), jeton_empreinte = NULL\n WHERE jeton_empreinte = $1\n   AND confirme_le IS NULL\n   AND jeton_expire_le > now()\nRETURNING id, profil;",
        "options": {
          "queryReplacement": "={{ $json.jeton_empreinte }}"
        }
      },
      "id": "confirmer-si-valide",
      "name": "Confirmer si valide",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.postgres",
      "typeVersion": 2.4,
      "position": [
        440,
        300
      ],
      "alwaysOutputData": true,
      "credentials": {
        "postgres": {
          "id": "REMPLACER",
          "name": "Postgres azy"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "beta-confirmee",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.id }}",
              "rightValue": "={{ null }}",
              "operator": {
                "type": "number",
                "operation": "exists"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "confirmée-?",
